---
description: Brightline Content Engine core rule
alwaysApply: true
---

Before starting any spec, and before making implementation changes, read:
- ai/AI_OPERATING_MANUAL.md
- ai/SPEC_TEMPLATE.md
- docs/ARCHITECTURE.md (when the work touches Review, the pipeline, or qcCard)

Follow these rules:
- Keep diffs minimal
- Do not redesign stable plumbing unless explicitly requested
- Backend is authoritative
- Be concrete and operational
- Do not add vague generative fallback behaviour
- A missing input must be loud at the point it goes missing (P31)
